{"seq":27,"slug":"query-optimization-execution","title":"数据库查询优化与执行引擎","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 数据库查询优化与执行引擎\n\n你写下一句 `SELECT ... JOIN ... WHERE ...`，数据库在毫秒之内就把它变成了磁盘上的字节读取、CPU 上的哈希探测和网络上的数据洗牌。这中间发生的一切——把声明式的 SQL 翻译成一份高效的物理执行计划，再由引擎逐行或逐批地跑完——正是这个 hub 要拆开讲清楚的东西。它是关系型数据库最硬核、也最能拉开产品差距的部分：同一条查询，朴素实现要跑十分钟，成熟优化器加向量化引擎可能只要几百毫秒。\n\n整个 hub 按一条真实的查询旅程组织成四章，层层递进。\n\n第一章「基础」铺设地基：一条查询从文本到结果要经过哪些阶段，关系代数如何成为优化器内部的中间语言，以及优化器据以做决策的代价模型与基数估计是怎么回事。这一章回答「优化器到底在优化什么」。\n\n第二章「访问方法」下沉到物理操作：数据存在 B+ 树索引里还是堆表里、用哪种扫描方式把它读出来、两张表又用什么算法连接起来。优化器所有的选择，最终都落到这些可执行的物理算子上。\n\n第三章「优化器」是全 hub 的大脑：先用等价规则把计划改写得更聪明（规则优化），再在庞大的计划空间里用动态规划或启发式搜索挑出代价最低的那个（代价优化），而这一切都依赖第三篇详述的统计信息与直方图来估准每一步的数据量。\n\n第四章「执行引擎」把选定的计划真正跑起来：从经典的火山模型到现代的向量化执行，从单机多核的 morsel 并行到跨节点的分布式洗牌，最后用 EXPLAIN 与可观测性手段把跑得慢的计划诊断出来、调回正轨。\n\n四章之间不是孤立的：基础章定义的代价与基数概念，是优化器章做决策的输入；访问方法章列出的物理算子，是优化器搜索空间里的备选项；而执行引擎章跑的，正是优化器最终选定的那份计划。读完这一条主线，你就能把「为什么这条 SQL 慢」从玄学问题变成可推理、可定位、可修复的工程问题。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"query-lifecycle","title":"查询生命周期与处理流程","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/foundations/query-lifecycle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"relational-algebra-plans","title":"关系代数与逻辑计划","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/foundations/relational-algebra-plans"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-model","title":"代价模型与基数估计","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/foundations/cost-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"access-methods","title":"访问方法","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/access-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"indexes-btree","title":"索引与 B+ 树","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/access-methods/indexes-btree"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scan-methods","title":"扫描与访问路径","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/access-methods/scan-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"join-algorithms","title":"连接算法","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/access-methods/join-algorithms"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization","title":"优化器","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rule-based-rewrite","title":"基于规则的查询重写","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/rule-based-rewrite"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-based-optimizer","title":"基于代价的优化器","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/cost-based-optimizer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"statistics-histograms","title":"统计信息与直方图","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/statistics-histograms"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"execution","title":"执行引擎","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/execution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"execution-models","title":"火山模型与向量化执行","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/execution/execution-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"parallel-distributed","title":"并行与分布式执行","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/execution/parallel-distributed"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tuning-observability","title":"查询调优与可观测性","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/execution/tuning-observability"}]}]}